Error [E0212]: `values` cannot be changed by `.push()` while `result` is still looking into it
  --> returned_view_blocks_owner_resize_and_move.jet:8:5
    |
  8 |     values.push(4)
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: `result` is a live read view into `values[…]`; changing or moving the owner could invalidate that view
 Fix: Finish using `result` before changing `values`, narrow the view's scope, or make an owned copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0212

Error [E0224]: This call writes `values`, but `values` has no `&` mark
  --> returned_view_blocks_owner_resize_and_move.jet:8:5
    |
  8 |     values.push(4)
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: The method is declared with `&self`, so the call writes the named place it is called on; the mark sits on that place, the same way `edit(&buf)` and `consume(^text)` mark arguments
 Fix: Write `&values`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0224
